  "instructions": "Slice tomatoes as shown in pic. Add Green Chutney and Sweet Chutney on top. Sprinkle Chaat Masala, Red Chili Powder and Kala Namak [optional] to taste. Spread grated carrots & finely chopped onion [optional] on top. Garnish with roasted and spiced peanuts, finely chopped cilantro, finely chopped green chillies [optional] and lemon juice.",
