  "text": "Recipe: Tomato Slice Chaat\nCreator: Ashwini Vikram\nCategory: Chaat\nIngredients: Tomatoes, Carrots, Onion, Green Chillies, Roasted & Spiced Peanuts, Chaat Masala, Red Chili Powder, Cilantro, Lemon Juice, Green Chutney, Sweet Chutney, Black Salt ('Kala namak')\nCooking methods: no-cook\nInstructions: Slice tomatoes as shown in pic. Add Green Chutney and Sweet Chutney on top. Sprinkle Chaat Masala, Red Chili Powder and Kala Namak [optional] to taste. Spread grated carrots & finely chopped onion [optional] on top. Garnish with roasted and spiced peanuts, finely chopped cilantro, finely chopped green chillies [optional] and lemon juice.\nNotes: A recipe with RAINBOW VEGGIES (tomato, carrot, onion), NUTS & SEEDS (peanuts), LIME-LEMON-VINEGAR (lemon juice), HERBS & SPICES (various). Green Chutney and Sweet Chutney are prepared components.",
